=80=9CI sell notes=E2=80=9D names a file. =E2=80=9CI help a React developer=
 understand why their extension loses state after a reload=E2=80=9D names a=
 situation in which an explanation, worked example, or review could be valu=
able. The paid result must be specific enough that you can describe what is=
 included and what a reasonable buyer should not expect.</p>
<p>Consider four situations:</p>
