<p><a id=3D"chapter-08-section-6"></a></p>
<h3>Implement the smallest reliable system</h3>
<p>You need a resource, a form, a delivery method, a way to contact subscri=
bers who opted in, and a place to fulfill a purchase. You do not need a cus=
tom application for each part. Your development skills can become a distrac=
tion if you spend three weeks building a storefront before testing whether =
