me series below is a communication design, not a promise that every step is=
 automated on the free plan. Start with supported manual broadcasts or a sm=
aller welcome flow, or pay only when the automation solves a real workload.=
 Recheck the current plan before committing. <a href=3D"https://kit.com/pri=
cing">Kit pricing</a>, <a href=3D"https://help.kit.com/en/articles/16627071=
-the-kit-free-plan">Kit free-plan details</a>.</p>
<p>Use one email platform rather than simultaneously operating three. If yo=
ur existing shop already delivers files reliably, test it before adding ano=
