a href=3D"https://gumroad.com/help/article/66-gumroads-fees">Gumroad fee de=
tails</a>, <a href=3D"https://docs.lemonsqueezy.com/help/getting-started/fe=
es">Lemon Squeezy fee details</a>.</p>
<p>Perform the entire path using your own test address and the platform's t=
