support.google.com/youtube/answer/13748639">YouTube's link-location guide</=
a>.</p>
<p>Use descriptive link labels such as =E2=80=9CFree browser-tool launch ch=
ecklist.=E2=80=9D An unlabeled list of shortened links asks for trust befor=
